* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_stgccl (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): a battery storage
* of electricity with a limit on its number of storage cycles over its lifetime, added to
* TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0), for M1.3 change 43:
* EQL_STGCCL (eqactups.vda L121-125) with the extra on-line capacity VAR_UPS(..,'ANNUAL','UP')
* that relaxes it at an annualised start-up cost (ACT_CSTUP at ANNUAL, coef_ext.vda L39;
* init_ext.vda L67 makes RP_PL 'UP', eqactups.vda L25 RP_UPS ANNUAL 'UP').
* - BATELC, a DAYNITE storage of ELC (PRC_MAP STG) in both regions.
* - REG1 is not vintaged, REG2 is (PRC_VINT) and has a past investment (NCAP_PASTI in 2000):
*   the capacity terms of %MX% for both (RVP_KMAP, COEF_VNT, NCAP_PASTI).
* - NCAP_AF UP by DAYNITE timeslice (COEF_AFUPS, coef_ext.vda L35): four values in REG1, one
*   in REG2 (WD), so SMAX(RPS_STG, COEF_AFUPS) takes the maximum over values and zeros.
* - STG_MAXCYC: one value in REG1; two years in REG2 (interpolated, prep_ext.vda L34).
* - demo12's electricity has the same price in every DAYNITE timeslice, so a storage earns
*   nothing by itself: STGOUT_BND sets a lower bound on each region's annual discharge, so the
*   cycle limit binds and the model chooses between more capacity (NCAP_COST) and the extra
*   on-line capacity VAR_UPS(..,'ANNUAL','UP') at the start-up cost.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC
/
BATELC 'Crafted: battery storage of electricity with a cycle limit (TIMES.jl demo12_stgccl)'
/
SET COM_GRP
/
BATELC_NRGO
/
SET COM_GMAP
/
REG1.BATELC_NRGO.ELC
REG2.BATELC_NRGO.ELC
/
SET PRC_MAP
/
REG1.STG.BATELC
REG2.STG.BATELC
/
SET PRC_TSL
/
REG1.BATELC.DAYNITE
REG2.BATELC.DAYNITE
/
SET PRC_ACTUNT
/
REG1.BATELC.BATELC_NRGO.PJ
REG2.BATELC.BATELC_NRGO.PJ
/
SET TOP
/
REG1.BATELC.ELC.IN
REG1.BATELC.ELC.OUT
REG2.BATELC.ELC.IN
REG2.BATELC.ELC.OUT
/
SET PRC_VINT
/
REG2.BATELC
/
PARAMETER
STG_EFF ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC 0.9
REG2.2005.BATELC 0.85
/
PARAMETER
NCAP_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC.MEURO05 2
REG2.2005.BATELC.MEURO05 3
/
PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC 15
REG2.2005.BATELC 12
/
PARAMETER
NCAP_PASTI ' '/
REG2.2000.BATELC 0.2
/
PARAMETER
NCAP_AF ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC.SD.UP 0.9
REG1.2005.BATELC.SN.UP 0.8
REG1.2005.BATELC.WD.UP 0.95
REG1.2005.BATELC.WN.UP 0.85
REG2.2005.BATELC.WD.UP 0.7
/
PARAMETER
STG_MAXCYC ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC 600
REG2.2005.BATELC 300
REG2.2030.BATELC 450
/
PARAMETER
ACT_CSTUP ' '/
REG1.2005.BATELC.ANNUAL.MEURO05 0.5
REG2.2005.BATELC.ANNUAL.MEURO05 0.8
/
PARAMETER
STGOUT_BND ' '/
REG1.2010.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 2
REG1.2015.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 2
REG1.2020.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 2.5
REG1.2030.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 3
REG2.2010.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 1
REG2.2020.BATELC.ELC.ANNUAL.LO 1.5
/
